501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋唐贤论史图","author":"刘克庄","text":"定是当时有难疑，一贤指画众肩随。\n而今纵有人挥麈，问者为谁听者谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋潘岳悼亡一首","author":"刘克庄","text":"长恨齐眉人已往，可怜尊足者犹存。\n乃知剑履图麟阁，不似琴书隐鹿门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道傍梅花","author":"刘克庄","text":"风吹千片点征裘，犹记相逢在岭头。\n岁晚建州城外见，向人似欲诉离愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锁谏图","author":"刘克庄","text":"谠言直触大单于，赖有阏氏上谏书。\n若把汉唐宫苑比，玉环飞燕总输渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁阵","author":"刘克庄","text":"出塞行行如出战，衔芦寂寂类衔枚。\n平沙夜宿排形势，谁为王师破得来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩祠三首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"莱相竹今供戍卒，武侯柏亦付胡儿。\n南来独有昌黎木，神物千年尚护持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩祠三首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text